y bonus, the +5 in the note. Science Math, Astronomy and Chemistry only is Mathematics: Basic, Mathematics: Advanced, Astronomy and Chemistry. W.P. any but no specialized gunfighting skills from Rifts New West excludes W.P. Sharpshooting and W.P. Quick Draw. Four at level one, two more at levels 3, 7 and 12. Secondary: four in total, no schedule printed. || MONEY: 2D6x100 credits (text layer 2D6xlOO) is starting_money; the 3D4x1000 (text layer 3D4xlOOO) in black market salable items is goods, in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT: the pair of Vibro-Blades reflecting the W.P. is a pick among Vibro-Knife, Vibro-Sword and Vibro-Saber, qty 2. NOT stored as rows: the heavy energy rifle and sidearm of choice (their six E-Clips each are stored as 12), three additional weapons of choice with three magazines each, the NG-S2 survival pack alternative to the backpack (no catalog row), the light and heavy suits of dark body armor, the vehicle, and personal items; they are in GM Notes. || CYBERNETICS: 1D4 implants of choice plus one bionic limb with two bionic weapons or features, in special_abilities; nothing fixed to store."
